+# Vintage Solo roster
+
+Checked 2026-09-08 against Forge ce5b0dbf17733847929e990c77274893223e1fa6.
+Each .dck contains exactly the source's 60-card main deck. Sideboards omitted.
+
+| File | Published list | Source |
+|---|---|---|
+| initiative.dck | Mono-White Initiative, Aetherhub, updated 2025-08-14 | https://aetherhub.com/Deck/mono-white-initiative-1350637 |
+| workshop.dck | WWolf, Vintage League, 2024-09-22, 5–0 | https://www.mtggoldfish.com/deck/download/6650070 |
+| oath.dck | Wesal, MTGO Challenge 32, 2026-09-03, 3–4 | https://mtgtop8.com/event?d=886421&e=90433&f=VI |
+
+Vintage restriction reference: https://magic.wizards.com/en/banned-restricted-list
+The relevant one-copy restrictions agree with the pinned Forge Vintage format.
+These are historical real lists, not a claim of the best current metagame choices.
+No banned cards from that list occur in these decks; all restricted inclusions are singletons.
+
+`python3 tools/vintage-solo/check.py` checks 60 cards, script existence and
+counts against the pinned Forge banned/restricted data. The report lists the
+script path for every card. It is NOT a test of correct runtime resolution.
+The actual selection screen also calls Forge's deck-conformance and Vintage
+legality validators before creating HostedMatch.
+
+Forge's existing scripts include Oath/Atraxa, initiative/Undercity, Workshop
+restricted mana, Sphere/Trinisphere, MDFCs and Urza's Saga. None of the selected
+scripts has `RemAIDeck:True`. That flag's absence does NOT prove strong AI support.
+Full-game interaction testing remains outstanding; no archetype has yet been
+replaced on the basis of measured runtime failure.
+
+This modified distribution retains Forge's GPL-3.0 license and copyright notices.
+See LICENSE.txt. No MTG Arena client assets were imported. Text-card rendering
+uses the existing Forge renderer. MTG names and card rules retain their respective
+rights; this is an unofficial personal-use project.
